WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.386
A tornado watch means be prepared.

00:00:02.386 --> 00:00:04.001
Tornadoes are possible.

00:00:04.001 --> 00:00:05.201
Review your plan.

00:00:05.201 --> 00:00:07.728
A tornado warning means take action.

00:00:07.728 --> 00:00:10.886
A tornado has been sighted or shown on radar.

00:00:10.886 --> 00:00:13.553
Take shelter when a warning is issued.

00:00:13.553 --> 00:00:16.010
Do not wait for a siren or a color.

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:18.600
Keep more than one way to get alerts.
